":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0039"},{"start":52,"end":54,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0052"},{"start":57,"end":58,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"719_b25_cc3_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0057"},{"start":62,"end":63,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0062"},{"start":72,"end":74,"surface":"諸王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"諸王群稱，不能合為一王。","candidate_person_ids":[],"id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0072"},{"start":85,"end":87,"surface":"杲之","kind":"person","person_id":"719_b25_cc3_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0085"},{"start":90,"end":92,"surface":"江淹","kind":"person","person_id":"d13_e54_8ba","status":"contextual_provisional","id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0090"},{"start":96,"end":98,"surface":"諸王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"諸王群稱，不能合為一王。","candidate_person_ids":[],"id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0096"},{"start":107,"end":110,"surface":"廬陵王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"齊廬陵王子卿候選；宋廬陵王紹不同時代，不憑同號合。","candidate_person_ids":[],"id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0107"},{"start":128,"end":130,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"右衛率所關聯太子待核任職時段，不據官名自動掛號。","candidate_person_ids":[],"id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066:m0128"}],"source_position":{"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"revision_id":1514487,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"text_layer":"received_chapter","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi","book_id":"b-nanqishu-034","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-034","source_id":"s-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi","source":{"title":"《南齊書》卷三十四〈庾杲之及附孔廣〉","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1514487","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1514487","revision_id":1514487,"accessed_on":"2026-10-19","extent":"庾杲之及附孔廣完整傳文單元，非全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄；未核底本影像","response_sha256":"2caa63316e7b1ba5314c93aae3eab684e6b6b442a2e4b674bd0a4e76a27d039c","wikitext_sha256":"c9c958070fff227bd14143a4ac7275ae1b53565c6f1eb27f29283b021955213e","rights":"古代正文；維基文庫數位轉錄保留來源及共享授權資訊。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"只移除段首全形縮排及-{征}-等顯示語法，原字征及爲／卽不轉換；數位注獨立層。","excerpts":[{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line060","source_lines":[60,60],"raw_quote":"　　庾杲之字景行，新野人也。祖深之，雍州刺史。父粲，司空參軍。","raw_quote_sha256":"cc447479d559d48b7ba65f71601d441dd0b241b332cf4420e73b376bf5ac71e1","selected_text_sha256":"47545dd42bf24b533d5ab42a4f6838e162e7eb632e2afffd8240e5e35ac1119c","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line062","source_lines":[62,62],"raw_quote":"　　杲之少而貞立，學涉文義。起家奉朝請，巴陵王-{征}-西參軍。郢州舉秀才，除晉熙王鎮西外兵參軍，世祖徵虜府功曹，尚書駕部郎。清貧自業，食唯有韭菹、𤅢韭、生韭雜菜，或戲之曰：「誰謂庾郎貧，食鮭常有二十七種。」言三九也。仍爲世祖撫軍中軍記室，遷員外散騎常侍，正員郎，遷中書郎，領荊、湘二州中正。","raw_quote_sha256":"b9bb58a27ccc9e3db473eb0aaf3659bfdfd585ccfa5e79b2eb96c6f6b43c0650","selected_text_sha256":"1b0f083f65878bb8f8f7060c200b09b7b10007fb2686870c2b53a9b6f5ff0450","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line064","source_lines":[64,64],"raw_quote":"　　轉尚書左丞，常侍、領中正如故。出爲王儉衛軍長史，時人呼入儉府爲芙蓉池。儉謂人曰：「昔袁公作衛軍，欲用我爲長史，雖不獲就，要是意向如此。今亦應須如我輩人也。」乃用杲之。遷黃門郎，兼御史中丞，尋卽正。","raw_quote_sha256":"d4743a0b50ed6325e26b636b8b54d09ee04a1db2dd57e4f257ecac5746ca51a5","selected_text_sha256":"2f4cd73e9b826f0d5436f566e6d31e2db5a409bb674353a9a85b25328b2ee2d5","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line066","source_lines":[66,66],"raw_quote":"　　杲之風範和潤，善音吐。世祖令對虜使，兼侍中。上每嘆其風器之美，王儉在座，曰：「杲之爲蟬冕所照，更生風采。陛下故當與其卽眞。」帝意未用也。永明中，諸王年少，不得妄與人接，敕杲之與濟陽江淹五日一詣諸王，使申游好。尋又遷廬陵王中軍長史，遷尚書吏部郎，參大選事。轉太子右衛率，加通直常侍。","raw_quote_sha256":"ed48ebf3aff20c9f8f4dd53caf918e6a08bd326858cb1b29a10b62942ebb992b","selected_text_sha256":"49d93669eb8ec5aa759d95dfa24836c095d4d5bf47057fe1b7dc4c679fa8ff0d","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line068","source_lines":[68,68],"raw_quote":"　　九年，卒。臨終上表曰：「臣昨夜及旦，更增氣疾，自省綿痼，頃刻危殆，無容復臥。任居隆顯，玷塵明世，乞解所忝，待終私庭。臣以凡庸，謬徼昌運，獎擢之厚，千載難逢。且年逾知命，志事榮顯，脩夭有分，無所厝言。若天鑒微誠，暫借餘歷，傾宗殞元，陳力無遠。仰違庭闕，伏枕鯁戀。送貂蟬及章。」詔不許。杲之歷在上府，以文學見遇。上造崇虛館，使爲碑文。卒時年五十一，上甚惜之。諡曰貞子。","raw_quote_sha256":"20da8e6514e1168d54d2b55dad4d6452201258a634c794562c9104f6f06ea27d","selected_text_sha256":"1215f309822c7b76ffe100d58e9d9ac59771037df0e84852bab3558906918f45","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]},{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-034-yugaozhi:line070","source_lines":[70,70],"raw_quote":"　　時會稽孔廣，字淹源，亦美姿制。歷州治中，卒。","raw_quote_sha256":"352f0a1acbc1191bd5bc2347dbbfe0dbc8fb986c41dfe289c659d7cbb78ce4d6","selected_text_sha256":"39a4e0d132053a8d4557b315d308f75712e86c6a28daabbe7aeb24643d7f6186","removed_digital_editorial_notes":[]}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true}}
